=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mclose\">))]</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.898em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.5763em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3263em;vertical-align:-1.5763em;\"></span><span class=\"minner munder\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.75em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.4237em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">自然间接效应</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"minner munder\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.75em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-2.102em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"stretchy\" style=\"height:0.548em;min-width:1.6em;\"><span class=\"brace-left\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M0 6l6-6h17c12.688 0 19.313.3 20 1 4 4 7.313 8.3 10 13\n 35.313 51.3 80.813 93.8 136.5 127.5 55.688 33.7 117.188 55.8 184.5 66.5.688\n 0 2 .3 4 1 18.688 2.7 76 4.3 172 5h399450v120H429l-6-1c-124.688-8-235-61.7\n-331-161C60.687 138.7 32.312 99.3 7 54L0 41V6z\"/></svg></span><span class=\"brace-center\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMin slice\"><path d=\"M199572 214\nc100.7 8.3 195.3 44 280 108 55.3 42 101.7 93 139 153l9 14c2.7-4 5.7-8.7 9-14\n 53.3-86.7 123.7-153 211-199 66.7-36 137.3-56.3 212-62h199568v120H200432c-178.3\n 11.7-311.7 78.3-403 201-6 8-9.7 12-11 12-.7.7-6.7 1-18 1s-17.3-.3-18-1c-1.3 0\n-5-4-11-12-44.7-59.3-101.3-106.3-170-141s-145.3-54.3-229-60H0V214z\"/></svg></span><span class=\"brace-right\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMaxYMin slice\"><path d=\"M399994 0l6 6v35l-6 11c-56 104-135.3 181.3-238 232-57.3\n 28.7-117 45-179 50H-300V214h399897c43.3-7 81-15 113-26 100.7-33 179.7-91 237\n-174 2.7-5 6-9 10-13 .7-1 7.3-1 20-1h17z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbb\">E</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">))</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mclose\">))]</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.898em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.5763em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>NDE 固定中介在对照组水平、只动处理；NIE 动处理并允许中介随之变化。这一反事实定义由 Pearl 在 2001 年的 UAI 论文《Direct and Indirect Effects》中系统化，思想源头可追溯到 Robins 与 Greenland 1992 年发表在《Statistics in Medicine》的工作。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    A[&quot;处理 A&quot;] --&gt; M[&quot;中介 M&quot;]&#10;    M --&gt; Y[&quot;结果 Y&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt;|&quot;直接通路&quot;| Y&#10;    UM[&quot;未观测混淆 U_M&quot;] --&gt; M&#10;    UM --&gt; Y\">flowchart LR\n    A[\"处理 A\"] --&gt; M[\"中介 M\"]\n    M --&gt; Y[\"结果 Y\"]\n    A --&gt;|\"直接通路\"| Y\n    UM[\"未观测混淆 U_M\"] --&gt; M\n    UM --&gt; Y</pre><p>要害在于：<strong>朴素回归里&quot;控制 M 后看 A 的系数&quot;并不等于 NDE</strong>。M 是处理后变量，控制它会打开图中对撞结构制造的伪相关（见后文 collider 陷阱）。分解必须在潜在结果层面定义，再谈估计。</p>\n<h2 id=\"baron-kenny-老方法为何被批判\">Baron-Kenny 老方法为何被批判</h2><p>Baron 与 Kenny 1986 年发表于《Journal of Personality and Social Psychology》的三步法统治了心理学与社会学三十年：先回归 M 对 A 检验显著；再回归 Y 对 A 与 M；若 A 的系数下降或不再显著，即宣称&quot;存在中介&quot;。它的问题在今天看来一目了然：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>只输出&quot;有/无中介&quot;的定性判断，不给间接效应的大小与置信区间，无法比较机制的相对重要性。</li>\n<li>隐含假设&quot;控制 M 后的系数就是干净的直接效应&quot;，却从未表述这个假设——它恰恰要求 M 与 Y 之间没有混淆。</li>\n<li>把第三步的&quot;不显著&quot;当作&quot;无直接效应&quot;的证据，混淆了低功效与真零。</li>\n<li>全程停留在回归系数的语言里，没有反事实，因此连&quot;分解的是什么&quot;都说不清。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Bullock、Green 与 Ha 2010 年在《Psychological Methods》上系统梳理了这些缺陷，标题就很有态度——《Yes, but what&#39;s the mechanism? (don&#39;t expect an easy answer)》。今天入门教材仍会教三步法，但严肃研究已整体转向反事实框架；把它继续用于决策归因属于明确的反模式。</p>\n<h2 id=\"现代框架-顺序可忽略性与-acme\">现代框架：顺序可忽略性与 ACME</h2><p>Imai、Keele 与 Tingley 2010 年发表于《Psychological Methods》的论文给出了统一识别框架。要识别 ACME（平均因果中介效应，即上文 NIE 的期望版本），需要<strong>顺序可忽略性</strong>两半：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>处理可忽略：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mi>Y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>Y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>M</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>M</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo><mo>⊥</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>∣</mo><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\{Y(1,m),Y(0,m),M(1),M(0)\\}\\perp A \\mid C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mclose\">)}</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">⊥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span>——给定协变量 C，处理像随机分配。</li>\n<li>中介可忽略：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>a</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⊥</mo><mi>M</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>∣</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>a</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Y(a&#x27;,m)\\perp M(a)\\mid A=a&#x27;, C=c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0019em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7519em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">⊥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9463em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7519em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span></span>——在处理层之内，中介的取值相对结果也像随机。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>在此之下 ACME 有闭式表达，按中介的条件分布积分即可：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>δ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msup><mi>a</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>∫</mo><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.8em\" maxsize=\"1.8em\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">E</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>Y</mi><mo>∣</mo><msup><mi>a</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>m</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>c</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo>−</mo><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">E</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>Y</mi><mo>∣</mo><mi>a</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>m</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>c</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.8em\" maxsize=\"1.8em\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><msub><mi>F</mi><mrow><mi>M</mi><mo>∣</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>m</mi><mo>∣</mo><mi>c</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\delta(a,a&#x27;)=\\int\\Big(\\mathbb{E}[Y\\mid a&#x27;,m,c]-\\mathbb{E}[Y\\mid a,m,c]\\Big)\\,\\mathrm{d}F_{M\\mid a}(m\\mid c)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0519em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8019em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.2222em;vertical-align:-0.8622em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\" style=\"margin-right:0.4445em;position:relative;top:-0.0011em;\">∫</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size2\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord mathbb\">E</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0519em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8019em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathbb\">E</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.8em;vertical-align:-0.65em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size2\">)</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">d</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.5198em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3552em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>估计流程因此是两阶段建模：拟合 M 的模型与 Y 的模型，再用蒙特卡洛模拟传播不确定性；配套的敏感性分析量化&quot;若存在违反第二条假设的隐藏混淆，它要多强才能翻转结论&quot;。R 包 mediation（Tingley、Yamamoto、Hirose、Keele 与 Imai，2014 年发表于《Journal of Statistical Software》）是该框架的标准实现；Python 生态没有同等成熟度的专用库，常见做法是用 statsmodels 手写两阶段加自举。VanderWeele 2015 年的专著《Explanation in Causal Inference》（牛津大学出版社）覆盖了受控直接效应等更多变体。</p>\n<p>关键认知：第一条假设可以由随机实验保证——所以实验数据同样能做中介分析；第二条假设<strong>在任何设计中都无法用数据检验</strong>，它是整个领域绕不开的阿喀琉斯之踵。</p>\n<h2 id=\"控制中介的对撞陷阱\">控制中介的对撞陷阱</h2><p>为什么不能把 M 当普通协变量放进主效应回归？看图：M 是 A 与 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>U</mi><mi>M</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">U_M</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的对撞节点。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    A[&quot;处理 A&quot;] --&gt;|&quot;因果&quot;| M[&quot;中介 M&quot;]&#10;    M --&gt; Y[&quot;结果 Y&quot;]&#10;    U2[&quot;隐藏变量 U_M (如用户活跃度)&quot;] -.-&gt;|&quot;同时驱动&quot;| M&#10;    U2 -.-&gt; Y\">flowchart LR\n    A[\"处理 A\"] --&gt;|\"因果\"| M[\"中介 M\"]\n    M --&gt; Y[\"结果 Y\"]\n    U2[\"隐藏变量 U_M (如用户活跃度)\"] -.-&gt;|\"同时驱动\"| M\n    U2 -.-&gt; Y</pre><p>一旦以 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span></span></span></span></span> 为条件，A 与 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>U</mi><mi>M</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">U_M</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 这两个原本独立的来源就被迫产生负相关（解释对撞变量的取值必然要在原因间&quot;分账&quot;），而 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>U</mi><mi>M</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">U_M</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 又直通 Y——于是一条纯粹的伪相关通路被打开，A 的&quot;条件系数&quot;里混入了与机制无关的垃圾分量。这解释了 Baron-Kenny 第三步为何系统性失真，也是&quot;多控制一个变量总是更准&quot;这条经验法则在处理后变量上的破产现场。三条实操红线：不要控制发生在处理之后的变量；发现 M 与 Y 存在共同原因时承认 ACME 无法识别（只能做敏感性区间）；中介测量误差会把效应错误地摊到直接通路上。</p>\n<h2 id=\"应用场景与选择指引\">应用场景与选择指引</h2><p>A/B 测试里的典型链条：新排序算法 → 曝光相关性提升 → 七日留存上升。随机化保证了处理可忽略，但机制归因依然要求论证第二重假设：曝光量与留存之间是否存在共同原因？活跃用户既看更多曝光又天然更留存——这个混淆几乎注定存在，敏感性分析从&quot;可选动作&quot;变成&quot;必做动作&quot;。工程要点有三：中介测量要在实验设计期规划（事后补埋点往往拿不到 M(a) 的可比分布）；多个中介并存时逐个归因要克制，分解结果对模型设定敏感；先看总效应与护栏指标、再做机制拆解，别让机制故事反过来污染对整体效果的判断（Kohavi 等在《Trustworthy Online Controlled Experiments》，2020 年剑桥大学出版社，中对此类实验纪律有系统讨论）。</p>\n<p>选择指引：只要&quot;是否有效&quot;→ 不必碰中介分析；要机制归因且能高质量测量 M、敢为中介无混淆押注 → 因果中介框架 + 敏感性分析；M 测不准或混淆明显 → 退而求其次，只报告探索性相关并明说局限。相邻方法上，若目的是&quot;让效应变大&quot;而非&quot;理解来源&quot;，异质处理效应分析（第五章）比机制分解更对症。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>中介分析把总效应分解为自然直接效应 NDE 与自然间接效应 NIE，分解必须在潜在结果层面定义（Pearl, 2001; Robins &amp; Greenland, 1992）。</li>\n<li>Baron-Kenny 三步法只有定性判断、隐含未声明假设、误读不显著，已被 Bullock 等（2010）系统批判，不宜用于严肃归因。</li>\n<li>现代框架依赖顺序可忽略性：第一半可由随机化保证，第二半永远不可检验——ACME 的可信度系于此。</li>\n<li>控制 M 会打开对撞路径制造伪相关；处理后变量一律不得当协变量。</li>\n<li>A/B 场景做机制归因：设计期埋好中介测量、必做敏感性分析、先总效应后机制故事。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"相关篇目\">相关篇目</h2><ul>\n<li><a href=\"../potential-outcomes/counterfactuals\">反事实与潜在结果</a>：NDE/NIE 定义所依赖的反事实语言。</li>\n<li><a href=\"../causal-graphs/backdoor-and-ladder\">后门准则与因果阶梯</a>：控制 M 为何会打开对撞路径的图论解释。</li>\n<li><a href=\"front-door-criterion\">前门准则：后门不可阻断时的替代识别策略</a>：同一中介变量的识别用法，与本篇的归因用法互为镜像。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"中介分析：把总效应分解为直接与间接","id":"中介分析-把总效应分解为直接与间接"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"中介变量与效应分解","id":"中介变量与效应分解"},{"level":2,"text":"Baron-Kenny 老方法为何被批判","id":"baron-kenny-老方法为何被批判"},{"level":2,"text":"现代框架：顺序可忽略性与 ACME","id":"现代框架-顺序可忽略性与-acme"},{"level":2,"text":"控制中介的对撞陷阱","id":"控制中介的对撞陷阱"},{"level":2,"text":"应用场景与选择指引","id":"应用场景与选择指引"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"相关篇目","id":"相关篇目"}],"prev":{"title":"前门准则：后门不可阻断时的替代识别策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/causal-inference/effect-decomposition/front-door-criterion"},"next":{"title":"合成控制法：面板数据上的虚拟对照组","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/causal-inference/effect-decomposition/synthetic-control"}}